  "query_preview": "..\n(Tuesday night through next Sunday)\nIssued at 1018 PM CDT Sun Aug 2 2026\n\nTuesday will be a rinse and repeat of Monday with potential Heat \nAdvisory temperatures continuing in the same area. Temperatures will \nbe slightly cooler on Wednesday as the ridge retreats slightly \nfarther west. It will finally move far enough west by Thursday to \nallow for the intrusion of shortwaves as a trough passes to the \nnorth. This will bring a return of thunderstorm chances, mainly to \nthe far southern Texas Panhandle Thursday and Friday evenings. PoPs \nhave been kept on the lower end as any storms do not look to be \nwidespread at this time.",
